@host = http://localhost:8080/api/v1
@token = paste-token-here

### 注册
POST {{host}}/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{"username":"demo_student","email":"demo@career.dev","password":"career123"}

### 当前画像
GET {{host}}/profiles/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### 创建岗位
POST {{host}}/jobs
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{"companyName":"未来科技","positionName":"Java 后端实习生","rawContent":"岗位要求：熟练掌握 Java 和 Spring Boot，掌握 MySQL；了解 Redis、Linux、Docker，有良好的计算机网络基础。"}

